      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Family Library Groups"
        ],
        "summary": "create a group",
        "description": "- The contextual family is the authorised user's family.\n    \n- There is a limit of 20 groups per family (anything over returns 400 Bad Request `group-limit`).\n    \n- The content Id's in `items` must be part of the family's library (any that aren't are filtered out).\n    \n- `items` is an Array - ordering is retained as provided upon create or update of a group.\n    \n- `items` can be an empty Array (families can have groups without content).\n    \n- Content can be added to as many groups as a family is allowed. A piece of content will only be stored and show once in a group (duplicate content is removed).\n    \n- Groups can have the same name. The name is UTF-8 so supports any unicode characters. There is a limit of 100 characters for the name (anything over 100 is truncated).\n    \n\n## ImageIds\n\nAn `imageId` can either be set to a [pre-made image ID](https://yoto.dev/reference/family-images), or an uploaded image ID.\n\n### Uploaded imageId\n\nThis is the ID returned after uploading an image to the Media API via the ['upload a family image'](https://yoto.dev/api/uploadAFamilyImage) endpoint. The resulting `imageUrl` generated for these images will be a URL pointing to the ['get a family image'](https://yoto.dev/api/getAFamilyImage) endpoint for the `imageId` which redirects to a signed S3 URL.\n\ne.g.\n\n`https://api.yotoplay.com/media/family/images/{imageId}`\n\n`https://api.yotoplay.com/media/family/images/1afea16db1aeb62f8ba84cdb191eee7c1dd734d23098b4756717c3e2bded8c6a`\n\n#### Required Scope\n\n`family:library:manage`",
        "operationId": "createAGroup",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "imageId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "fp-cards"
                  },
                  "items": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "contentId": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "37KwQ"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "example": [
                      {
                        "contentId": "37KwQ"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "My Favourites"
                  }
                }
              },
              "examples": {
                "create a group": {
                  "value": {
                    "imageId": "fp-cards",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "contentId": "37KwQ"
                      }
                    ],
                    "name": "My Favourites"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
